From f90c64532c833852bf57c1f50554508d4541b6ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: suiyan <suiyan@sunmmio.com>
Date: Mon, 29 Jun 2026 17:20:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] target/dadao: add DADAO SimRISC target skeleton

Add initial QEMU target skeleton for DADAO SimRISC:
- target/dadao/: CPU state, QOM registration, TCG translation skeleton
- configs/targets/dadao-softmmu.mak: Default target config (big-endian)
- hw/dadao/: M1 test machine with ROM, RAM, exit port MMIO
- Update target/meson.build, target/Kconfig, hw/Kconfig to register
